<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs off $0.50/1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs off $0.50/1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50-1.00 lower. Demand and movement light to moderate. Top $60.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>			     Country:	     Plants</p>
<p>US 1-2  220-260 lbs.   58.00-59.00	  58.50-60.00</p>
